Zenith is an extraction and adaptation of the Apache-2.0 ai_workflow
research system. Source paths, extraction hashes and local adaptations are
recorded in docs/extraction-manifest.json. Later changes are recorded in
this repository's history. The parent source license notice identifies
Will Cook as the copyright holder.

Retained Arthera research skills are separately attributed in
third_party/skills/import_manifest.json and retain their Apache-2.0 license
at third_party/skills/arthera/LICENSE. Their originals are unchanged;
repo-local adapters have separate paths.

The included UCI Dow Jones Index dataset is CC BY 4.0, not Apache-2.0.
Retain data/historical/ATTRIBUTION.md and source_manifest.json when reusing
that data. Software licensing does not grant rights to provider responses,
market feeds or separately acquired datasets. Reference-only architecture
sources and their pins are recorded in docs/architecture-sources.json.
